<h2>Best Practices</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Use during renewal reviews</strong> – Run the Gap Highlighter as part of your renewal process to identify upsell opportunities</li>
    <li><strong>Customize the selection</strong> – Don't include every gap; focus on the most relevant ones for each client</li>
    <li><strong>Add context</strong> – After copying the report, add your own notes or explanations before sending</li>
    <li><strong>Review before sending</strong> – Always review the generated report to ensure it's accurate and appropriate</li>
    <li><strong>Use for proposals</strong> – Include gap reports in proposals to show clients what they're missing</li>
    <li><strong>Frame positively</strong> – Present gaps as opportunities to improve coverage, not as problems</li>
</ul>

