<h2>When to Use the Gap Highlighter</h2>

<p>
    The Gap Highlighter is particularly useful for:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Renewal conversations</strong> – When discussing coverage options with clients during renewals</li>
    <li><strong>Upsell opportunities</strong> – Identifying and presenting additional coverage needs</li>
    <li><strong>Proposal preparation</strong> – Including coverage analysis in proposals</li>
    <li><strong>Client education</strong> – Helping clients understand what coverages they have and what they might need</li>
    <li><strong>Quick assessments</strong> – Getting a fast overview of a policy's coverage status</li>
</ul>

