<h2>Troubleshooting</h2>

<h3>No Policy Data Available</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Ensure you're launching the tool from a renewal that has an associated policy</li>
    <li>Verify the policy has coverage information entered</li>
    <li>Check that the policy is active and not expired</li>
</ul>

<h3>Missing Coverage Information</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Some coverages may not be detected if the policy data is incomplete</li>
    <li>Review the policy record and ensure all coverage types are properly entered</li>
    <li>The tool only analyzes data that's in Quickfire, not information from PDFs unless they've been processed</li>
</ul>

<h3>Report Not Generating</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Ensure at least one gap recommendation is selected</li>
    <li>Check that the policy has been fully loaded</li>
    <li>Try refreshing the page and running the analysis again</li>
</ul>

